AB  - IoT-based Vehicle Management System has been designed for enhanced safety, security, and location tracking in real-time for the vehicle. The system has RFID for entry control, load cell for overload, MQ4 sensor for alcohol detection, wet sensor for detection against fuel theft, and GSM/GPS for location tracking of the vehicle. The system prevents unauthorized personnel from operating the vehicle, prevents overloading by shutting off the engine and sending a notification to the owner, detects alcohol consumption by the driver, monitors fuel level to prevent fuel theft, and tracks the location of the vehicle in real-time. The owner receives notification through the Blynk application and email. The system has been designed for enhanced vehicle management, less accidents, and enhanced security for the vehicle owner.
