AB  - This project is to design and develop an affordable user friendly low cost vehicle black box i.e real time data monitoring with speed control operation of the vehicle in restricted zone. The system does major operation which is data monitoring that records various parameters like, state of driver(both drowsiness of driver, alcohol consumption of driver), seat belt state, crash state, engine temperature and speed control of the vehicle. System design uses ARM7 as embedded microcontroller. It also uses GPS and GSM modules to identify the position of vehicle and to transfer the real time data to central station. The main advantage of this system is low power consumption since ARM7 is used as an embedded microcontroller. And also cost to implement overall system is low.
