AB  - In the Modern world the use of vehicles has sig-nificantly increased. The heavy usage of vehicles has increased traffic, which has increased the number of accidents on the roadways. Due to the absence of immediate access to safety and preventative measures, this affects the property and results in deaths. Although total accident prevention may not be possible, the effects can at least be minimised. This embedded system has the ability to stop accidents from occurring and has implemented the appropriate safety measures. The location and a link to a Google map were given to the police station and ambulance service's smart devices, which are able to accessing mobile networks, to ensure that they can easily locate the location. The system includes an accelerometer, GPS module, GSM module, alcohol sensor, temperature sensor, and eye blink sensor.
